{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_05",
  "title": "通往舞會的邀請函",
  "storyCode": "SS-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "02590cc3c358048ebb830e1ad23cdc9996e5dd366a8b03e775e0683078693186",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "呼……呼……唔……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉悶的聲音在空曠的洞穴中迴盪，那是附近仍未停止作業的掘地機發出的聲響。\n氣溫越來越低。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "跑出洞穴的那一刻，寒意同時到來。\n而寒冷，只會讓她心臟的跳動不斷加快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "我該……該怎麼面對她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無法開口，無法面對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘖嘖嘖，該如何是好呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無須回頭，她已然知道來者是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "這個孩子的夢境，我真的很滿意呢~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "夢城堡的職責就是讓每個孩子都有一場好夢，我一一實現了她的願望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "沒想到這個夢境這麼穩定地運轉——不，甚至完美無缺，完全超出了我的預期。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "而且在這裡，有一些很有趣的事情正在發生哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "……你在欺騙她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "不不不，這才不算是欺騙呢。我和她交易了很多次，她很清楚我的身分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "看到這個結果，我也很開心呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "就算意識到是夢境，依舊不願意離開，那不就說明我的造夢技藝無人能比嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡爾頓們",
      "text": "（贊同的哼唧聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "哦，最後來的竟然是……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "還蠻有趣的呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "text": "我就不打擾你們了~豐川祥子，相信你很快也會發現這個夢境的有趣之處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "text": "祥子，大家都在等你呢，我們回去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "回去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "你看著莫菲絲消失，卻一點都不驚訝……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "text": "這裡的一切，都是我們虛構出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "“我們”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "text": "你，不屬於我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "text": "小睦，你彈得好棒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "text": "祥……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "text": "不對，媽媽……祥，她跑去哪裡了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "text": "小祥？可能跑去其他地方了吧……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "text": "不對，不對。祥……祥她不可能丟下我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歡呼的人群突然變得一片死寂，所有人都目不轉睛地看著睦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "text": "小睦，你好像忘記了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "text": "這裡不是你一個人的夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦的母親”",
      "text": "這裡是“我們”的夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "“我們”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "在這個夢境裡，每一個“睦”都有機會實現自己的願望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我們和小睦一起，構建出了只屬於我們的美夢——大家都能得到幸福的夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我們存在於小睦的腦海中，觀看了無數遍她的人生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "最後，我們一致認為，對於所有的“睦”來說，這就是最好的結局——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "而你，豐川祥子，你是這個美夢的敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "睦，你到底在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "我也不希望你繼續痛苦下去，但是我們都不應該繼續躲在這樣的夢裡——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "不，小睦能在這裡幸福地生活下去，這才是最重要的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我和大家不一樣，我想和祥子好好談談。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你可以留在這裡，和我一起，守護小睦的美夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "小睦是一個脆弱的孩子，她可能還無法決定，到底是醒來，還是就這樣幸福下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "只要你也選擇留在這裡，幫我們一起讓這個夢持續下去，那夢境自然就會變成“現實”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你是“現實”唯一的基準，你就是“現實”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "所以，留下來吧，祥子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "我拒絕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你……拒絕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "睦現實中的身體正躺在冰冷的夢城堡裡，你覺得這樣的結局也是好的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "如果你真的愛她，就不會做出這種事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "只要能讓小睦開心，只要我們都能存在——是不是現實又有什麼關係？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我擁有小睦的所有記憶，我知道你心裡最需要什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "只要你願意留在這裡，我甚至能給你一個完整的Ave{@nbs}Mujica！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "閉嘴！你根本就不是睦……睦才不會這樣說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我喜歡你，也喜歡小睦……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你為什麼要讓我陷入兩難？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫名的聲音盤旋在兩人的頭頂上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠方的山脈好像在震動，地上的碎石也有節奏地跳動了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周圍明明沒有其他人，祥子卻覺得好像有無數雙眼睛正在盯著自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "他們說得對，我們對小睦來說就是無數的影子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "為了讓影子能一直躲在黑暗裡，再微弱的光也要抹去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“睦”一點一點地將祥子逼到了懸崖邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "text": "……你想做什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "祥子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“睦”伸出了手，將手放在了祥子的肩膀上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子失去了平衡，“睦”離她越來越遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "祥子，我想要小睦一直快樂下去，我也想要所有的“睦”都不再消失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "可是我沒有辦法……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "小睦，不需要你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "永別了，祥子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
